{"title":"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5(Jaideep&#39;s_Difference_of_Roots_Equals_Integer_Method)[JDRIM]\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5(Jaideep's Difference of Roots Equals Integer Method)[JDRIM]</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6_(Fast_version_of_solution_1)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6 (Fast version of solution 1)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/2/60260471de484d4c7c3af264a757d4ff5de2ad3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{49-x^2}-\\sqrt{25-x^2}=3\\]\" width=\"200\" height=\"18\" />What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/b/5ab28cdf200347891a719c96614ec4cc5a7c3f1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/8/238a79e0d099c672d9c284d8344a3a6bbb53e60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }8\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\sqrt{33}+8\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }9\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }2\\sqrt{10}+4\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }12\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"482\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c463c738b4c3da41d141ff76ef41999330a9a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"205\" height=\"21\" />; in other words, we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/4/d54d24ada752d5705d46a862977cf47f7507fc08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\cdot3=\\left(\\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\sqrt{49-x^2}-\\sqrt{25-x^2}\\right)=\\left(\\sqrt{49-x^2}\\right)^2-\\left(\\sqrt{25-x^2}\\right)^2=\\left(49-x^2\\right)-\\left(25-x^2\\right)=24.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"945\" height=\"37\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4dbcd5f95f7231dfd2454600049482d5fce8971d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\boxed{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"56\" height=\"25\" />. \n</p><p>~Technodoggo\n</p><p>Alternative method:\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c463c738b4c3da41d141ff76ef41999330a9a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"205\" height=\"21\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/9/c699907ad445d5bbead4114aec60b2f3057dcae6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=\\sqrt{49-x^2}-\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"203\" height=\"21\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/f/2df8bb53baea8ff0e2498616a20019e1ccedd74c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\cdot b=49-x^2 - 25 + x^2 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"238\" height=\"18\" />. The problem states that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/6/626beed3a7eee094ce4b6cf79a49d81669f72d99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, so we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/4/494ee37390980f24dd27db714790810f749c7945.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{24}{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"38\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fda1f7560dff1702ae806ca496e4676d6d90223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~SwordAxe\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/f/92f434bc24e78c014c0f161503fca11380545ac5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\sqrt{49-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"109\" height=\"21\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96d6323235bbb7aedbabd4874c620fafe6b6878b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"107\" height=\"21\" />. Solving for the constants in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> , and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/d/37d3bbc3783abe53720f81f353e6f71692a89907.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 + x^2 = 49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18d3715249d1512ba3e8a524a002d09e02c1f305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2 + x^2 = 25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"100\" height=\"18\" />. Subtracting the second equation from the first gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46deb4eece782d6585a1b074a2bbc53db691b593.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2 - b^2 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />. Difference of squares gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/2/7322314421df70f123871744304fbd5115862435.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)(a-b) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"20\" />. Since we want to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/1/341fc642b0f6e0990face554b39881c5771ca4ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\sqrt{49-x^2}+\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"235\" height=\"21\" />, and we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/c/a4c17ccdcb20e2a8d90ffc1b3ea56562fe4f82f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-b = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/8/3d8838e378953bdf47be39051b6e1f782c854446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(a+b) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"107\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/b/96b248d1d2d85d5d17643a8d833bc8bdd5232364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/c/c2ca1e2c5c494b3abe7e735e7db17e3b519ad9ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25 - x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"18\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, thus turning the equation into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e6077c127f7c10d3f2793daf4facd0e4679598ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a+24} - \\sqrt{a} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"147\" height=\"22\" />. Moving the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/a/90a7c63137f663d673aa6a24a2403fb14cfe480f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"18\" /> to the other side and squaring gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ffb69a7f4556a8ed8759123aac3b42f28b6c24b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 24 = 9 + 6\\sqrt{a} + a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"173\" height=\"21\" />, solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> gives us 25/4. We substitute this value into the expression they asked us to evaluate giving 8.\n</p><p>~ SAMANTAP\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f1f4aa71c5ae579cc2556cc089b46348ed3897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" /> to the right to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/c/7dc18318a73f1729e342450d85839cbb79db61ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{49-x^2} = 3 + \\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"204\" height=\"21\" />. \nSquare both sides to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/5/3b53a44ed163a4a39dad53fe4a709851bf876012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$49-x^2 = 9 + 6\\sqrt{25-x^2} + (25-x^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\" />.\nSimplify to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/b/83b4b4a2b5acc2584519a56c4668792012790d93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 = 6\\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"127\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/8/0981dc11bdc632c354d5f01c54afe27a0e0fddc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{2} = \\sqrt{25-x^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" />\nSubstitute this back into the original equation tog et that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/9/499e6c941ac2372a6b4ef137a3b3e512afd3ca47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{49-x^2} = \\frac{11}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"122\" height=\"38\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fda1f7560dff1702ae806ca496e4676d6d90223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5.28Jaideep.27s_Difference_of_Roots_Equals_Integer_Method.29.5BJDRIM.5D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5(Jaideep's_Difference_of_Roots_Equals_Integer_Method)[JDRIM]\">Solution 5(Jaideep's Difference of Roots Equals Integer Method)[JDRIM]</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5(Jaideep&#39;s Difference of Roots Equals Integer Method)[JDRIM]\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/d/8bd869fbecd3b6638201b633d0980075a7d06520.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt(49-x^2) - \\sqrt(25-x^2) = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"238\" height=\"35\" />\nWe are asked to find, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/9/ba91b0d181d857d1f3f4ac3fce1bd13e72e90c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt(49-x^2) + \\sqrt(25-x^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"204\" height=\"35\" />\nNotice that these two expressions are conjugates of one another. Therefore, we can find that by multiply these two conjugates by one another we should be able to find that: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/c/3ac61fa995fb463eafa65fb89d93ed2a7e3c6ccf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\sqrt(49-x^2) - \\sqrt(25-x^2))(\\sqrt(49-x^2) + \\sqrt(25-x^2)) = (49-x^2) - (25-x^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"626\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efe1e83e8d21d5a971f3311332a0dd46f7f25592.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow 49-x^2-25+x^2 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"206\" height=\"18\" />\nWe are already given that the first expression equals 3, thus, our expression now becomes: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/5/b15b7c3ae808b0fc266e637ea7413e4bac7425d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(\\sqrt(49-x^2)+\\sqrt(25-x^2)) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"270\" height=\"35\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/3/333ede71514001e132515b8488393b27e4bcc7c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\sqrt(49-x^2)+\\sqrt(25-x^2) = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"261\" height=\"35\" />\nThus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fda1f7560dff1702ae806ca496e4676d6d90223.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A) }8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"58\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~im_space_cadet\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_6_.28Fast_version_of_solution_1.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6_(Fast_version_of_solution_1)\">Solution 6 (Fast version of solution 1)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6 (Fast version of solution 1)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let \\( a = \\sqrt{49-x^2} \\) and \\( b = \\sqrt{25-x^2} \\). Then, we have (1) \\( a - b = 3 \\) and \\( a^2 = b^2 + 24 \\) or (2) \\( a^2 -\nb^2 = 24 \\). Notice that \\( a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b) \\). So, dividing (1) by (2), we get that \\( a + b = \\sqrt{49 - x^2} + \\sqrt{25 \n- x^2} = \\frac{24}{3} = 8 \\).\n</p><p>~maxd3\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/P-atxiiTw2I\">https://youtu.be/P-atxiiTw2I</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1403\">https://youtu.be/ba6w1OhXqOQ?t=1403</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zQG70XKAdeA\">https://youtu.be/zQG70XKAdeA</a> ~ North America Math Contest Go Go Go\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZiZVIMmo260\">https:/